<title>HONG KONG: Glaxo Wellcome names first Asian to board.</title>
<headline>Glaxo Wellcome names first Asian to board.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glaxo Wellcome Plc said on Thursday it appointed Arthur Li, vice-chancellor of the Chinese University of Hong Kong, as a non-executive director with effect from January 1.</p>
<p>Li is the first Asian being appointed to Glaxo Wellcome's board, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
